<p>The Public Administration Program follows academic grievance policies and procedures provided by the University of Hawaiʻi at Mānoa (UHM) <a href="https://manoa.hawaii.edu/studentsuccess/academic-grievance/">Office of Student Affairs</a> and <a href="https://manoa.hawaii.edu/graduate/graduate-student-grievances/">Graduate Division</a>.</p>
<h3>Student Conduct Code</h3>
<p>The Public Administration Program follows <a href="https://manoa.hawaii.edu/studentsuccess/conduct-code/">student conduct code</a> policies and procedures provided by the UHM Office of Student Affairs.</p>
